{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5f23cd0a1d1cc5075c6b7f5409d2ff64849371e5a57f4c56bc2b863ad3580245","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"microsoft/amplifier@28588b93886d snapshot 4ae0b5b7a1d69299","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6540948e675b33ce5ab2da9198a19a21dba60b9b98b062fc2d07a89c6e097881","slc_8f0e9e633810fa69162ef9f13d21b53b58b39a79887aeb4dcc363c0144beb334","slc_9a1f31d8353a79f871b83fd80d66149bf2955a3e36dde8cdf0a522bb01e79763","slc_fa9ea96a62d68ded0fcac3b5c409d6f5f410475f1e5adc9b0f040ef739db05a0"],"source_ids":["src_76647e7a95ad50b1a5935bb534ffdf39"],"text":"Providers are switched with commands like 'amplifier provider use openai' or explicit flags such as --model and --deployment; bundles are added and activated with 'amplifier bundle add' and 'amplifier bundle use'.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_826e6306bbdac5ac13e2013ae1369de1c5a011ac42d60cea392ddc8e46e0da39","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"microsoft/amplifier@28588b93886d snapshot 4ae0b5b7a1d69299","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_200da423393ba214ca61c94e04f537ee52a18a25e07521b0ec9cc2e0627d5dca"],"source_ids":["src_76647e7a95ad50b1a5935bb534ffdf39"],"text":"The project builds on separate ecosystem repos: amplifier-core, a roughly 2,600-line kernel providing module protocols, session lifecycle, and hooks, and amplifier-foundation, a bundle composition library plus the default foundation bundle.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a26993efb185ee35ced6adbddb41155da058d46c48382d1e514300c4bc200c94","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"microsoft/amplifier@28588b93886d snapshot 4ae0b5b7a1d69299","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4b074485eb8ebc535bafa28ec3c3bbc90ca032f7e4cd7751bc98171c993a1cc4","slc_5b92752d0ae8908ace0d9ddd5e6509e080a19f63440814fb0e9b7da4c56c49b4","slc_6ca2f54886bba423452dfc3b380f0c4f6c3f752bab4fbf2193d2a39258658e5a"],"source_ids":["src_76647e7a95ad50b1a5935bb534ffdf39"],"text":"Bundles are composable configuration packages defining tools, providers, agents, and behaviors; the default 'foundation' bundle includes filesystem, bash, web, search, and task-delegation tools plus 14 specialized agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cab973f079ba450cab067414c89d55ea3da7b9bb45dad0be19eed1dd998e408e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"microsoft/amplifier@28588b93886d snapshot 4ae0b5b7a1d69299","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_05766676aaac577a5e7220aca480bc16993465256ce5c5f53fef8d6f720ccc7a","slc_17b193e1bac3e9d74c18a209585f334b1bce9f3e1e0ae281af27a753db17c829","slc_bde0861e4de7d69e9eca494e2edaa740756e06ace5488516d55f85c8c5db282c"],"source_ids":["src_76647e7a95ad50b1a5935bb534ffdf39"],"text":"Supported AI providers include Anthropic Claude (recommended and most tested), OpenAI, Azure OpenAI with managed identity support, and Ollama for local free use; other providers are acknowledged as needing more testing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d5560c1df3035c0971e1a927de12d61acbb413349ee2fccb3e24ae8cf52713dc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"microsoft/amplifier@28588b93886d snapshot 4ae0b5b7a1d69299","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_68cdac177f7a16895a41c5d17feab67f5062becb194288de257a1565dc477ccc","slc_e2e19f66843d9685ffae2bba9ad406d3eb17ac8151f304ca046726180e7edb46"],"source_ids":["src_76647e7a95ad50b1a5935bb534ffdf39"],"text":"Amplifier is a command-line AI assistant with a modular, extensible architecture; the CLI is described as just one reference interface for the underlying modular platform.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d764a6d731b7050577da4e9535a392caad46ed70569d61df72c0fe49b643b2d6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"microsoft/amplifier@28588b93886d snapshot 4ae0b5b7a1d69299","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a2476fc4eb74043df56ced063b132224cb0f7668bb538f4b10821b52074466a0","slc_ac9244c54a44bcbfb710b91fff08de6aa093c6b25ea5131faeb7b3eccef010e7"],"source_ids":["src_59514b538a1a5efd8843e2f8a517943d"],"text":"Routing matrices map semantic model roles to ordered provider/model candidates, but routing applies only when the composed bundle mounts a routing strategy such as the routing-matrix hook.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d99c7d6b39df0f0d2203b1679d7f215aae5e97f3991ef53793cbe136a09d03df","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"microsoft/amplifier@28588b93886d snapshot 4ae0b5b7a1d69299","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4e1b2b636034190be960ad2161a2d977b14c9007948a334fdfd70055f0c0ac46","slc_6f353705908dda0db1fc2d4a9bd9224fd0c1d749ed41113c3e6f9ef41ffef10b","slc_88bd22a1ae97fd310d605e6c3a884cded1f115e89ecc47b9184f19d6cba34e30","slc_cdad5b9e1c667c757cb0bf76f94c891083e654ffd902489df23fa6137e101b33"],"source_ids":["src_76647e7a95ad50b1a5935bb534ffdf39"],"text":"Every interaction is automatically saved and sessions are project-scoped; users can list sessions for the current project or across all projects with 'amplifier session list' and its --all-projects flag.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:19:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9548086c8d204bf19c0ec746fe647207"}
